    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεᾱ-νομέω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκρεανόμηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					9.33
				</span></i>
			:—<i>divide the flesh</i> of a victim among the
			guests, l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <i>distribute meat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ βουλῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.847.25
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>divide, cut piecemeal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				34.12
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
				20
			</span></i>: with pl. subject, <i>divide among themselves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				26.24
			</span></i>.</div>
